, {"id": 40159, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/wfcqbzfo0fuaxdmisua5.jpg"}], "slug": "sonic-cd", "storyline": "Sonic travels to the distant shores of Never Lake for the once-a-year appearance of Little Planet - a mysterious world where past, present, and future collide through the power of the Time Stones that lie hidden within it.\n\nSonic arrives only to find the once beautiful world imprisoned beneath a twisted metallic shell. His arch-nemesis, Dr. Eggman, has come for the Time Stones and with them, will soon have the power to control time itself!\n\nIn order to put an end to Dr. Eggman\u2019s nefarious schemes, Sonic must use the power of Little Planet to travel through time; breaking Dr. Eggman\u2019s hold over the future by destroying his machines in the past and recovering the missing Time Stones!", "summary": "A fast-paced platformer that follows Sonic as he races through time-traveling zones to rescue past and future versions of stages and stop Dr. Robotnik\u2019s time-altering plans. Combining classic Sonic speed and precision with CD-quality music, animated cutscenes, and branching time-based routes, it rewards quick reflexes and exploration to unlock true endings.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sonic-cd", "videos": [{"id": 36270, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "8NVjKy0v3MU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8NVjKy0v3MU", "title": "Longplay of Sonic CD", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8NVjKy0v3MU/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 88990, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "WyQbb64B9fU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WyQbb64B9fU", "title": "Sonic CD Commercial", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WyQbb64B9fU/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 144675, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "Lft02DuvqnQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lft02DuvqnQ", "title": "Sonic CD Intro [HD]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Lft02DuvqnQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "coll